  "title": "India's Uttar Pradesh Assembly Elections: SP Offers Congress 26 Seats for 2027",
  "summary": "The Samajwadi Party (SP) has offered 26 seats to the Congress for the 2027 Uttar Pradesh Assembly elections, marking a shift in the political dynamics of the state. The two parties are set to discuss seat-sharing for the upcoming elections, with the SP securing 60,000-70,000 votes and the Congress receiving only around 2,000 votes. The government's statement highlights the ongoing political tensions between the two parties.",
